@baseUrl = http://localhost:5200

### Correct endpoint: JSON array with nested category objects.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/productlist
Origin: http://localhost:5100
Accept: application/json

### Repeat within 30 seconds: X-Generated-At should be identical.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/productlist
Origin: http://localhost:5100

### Old route: expected 404.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Allowed-origin preflight: expected 204 and allow-origin header.
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/productlist
Origin: http://localhost:5100
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type

### Disallowed origin: no Access-Control-Allow-Origin header.
# CORS is a browser policy, not API authentication; Postman can still read the response.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/productlist
Origin: http://untrusted.example
